column47:
*Why:* from List of payments there will be less information about payment available than from payment file. Therefore API should be updated
*When:* 
*Where:*  core-payment-batch-handler-data-manager
*What:*

API name: payment/create

 

Incoming parameters:
 * Batch SID - mandatory
 * Signing batch SID - optional
 * Status - mandatory
 * Reporting status - mandatory
 * Original Instruction Identification - optional
 * Original End To End Identification - optional
 * Requested Execution Date - optional
 * Country code - mandatory
 * dp.id - optional
 * Instructed amount - {color:#ff8b00}optional{color}
 * Currency - {color:#ff8b00}optional{color}
 * Debtor name - {color:#ff8b00}optional{color}
 * Debtor account number - {color:#ff8b00}optional{color}
 * Creditor name - {color:#ff8b00}optional{color}
 * Creditor account number - {color:#ff8b00}optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Creditor account type - optional{color}

 

{color:#ff8b00}Validations:{color}

{color:#ff8b00}These fields can only be all provided together - if at least one is missing, there should be error in API response. If all are missing - do not create entry in payment_info table{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Instructed amount - optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Currency - optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Debtor name - optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Debtor account number - optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Creditor name - optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Creditor account number - optional{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Creditor account type - optional{color}

{color:#ff8b00}These fields cannot be negative:{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Instructed amount{color}

{color:#ff8b00}This field have to allow only LT, LV, EE values:{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Country code{color}

{color:#ff8b00}This field can have only IBAN or OTHER values:{color}
 * {color:#ff8b00}Creditor account type{color}

