column47:
Create a new procedure "{*}MDM_AGREEMENT_BDP{*}" in  "{*}PAYMENTS_AGREEMENTS_MDM.MDM_PAYLOAD_MESSAGE_GENERATION{*}" (PAYRUN-1515) to generate payload message for the Bank Defined Payments agreements in product CORE DB (LV) 

The new package must be able to:
 * Generate [Agreement Summary payloads|https://wiki.swedbank.net/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=842727454#expand-Engagementpayload] messages based on input parameters and add it into queue "{*}PAYMENTS_AGREEMENTS_MDM.MDM_MESSAGES{*}"  (PAYRUN-1390)

Input parameters:
* i_operation - VARCHAR2, possible values: INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE;
* i_agreement_id - NUMBER, crebit.tyyp_mk.tm_lep_nr
* i_status - VARCHAR2, crebit.tyyp_mk.olek
* i_dt_from - DATE, crebit.tyyp_mk.start_date
* i_dt_till - DATE, crebit.tyyp_mk.end_date
* i_last_updated_time - TIMESTAMP, cast crebit.tyyp_mk.millal to timestamp
* i_customer_id - VARCHAR2, crebit.tyyp_mk.customer_id

On input parameter *i_operation* value  *INSERT* or *UPDATE* generate the following payload message:
{code:java}
{
  "sourceSystemId": "",         // STATIC VALUE - (string) - use "PAYMENTS" as value 
  "correlationId": "",          // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use "YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_CREBIT.TYYP_MK[TM_LEP_NR]", Format:20240509_110414_6940174571   
  "instanceId": "",             // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string)- use "LV" as value
  "type": "",                   // STATIC VALUE - (string) - use "ENGAGEMENT" as value
  "lastModifiedTimestamp": ,    // DYNAMIC VALUE - (long timestamp) - use CREBIT.TYYP_M MILLAL column value, format: unix timestamp milliseconds
  "operation": "",              // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) depends on type of event trigger captured, possible values: "INSERT", "UPDATE"
  "payload": {                  // (object) Details of the change
    "engagementSourceRef": "",  // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK[TM_LEP_NR],  Format: <shema_name>.<table_name>[<unique record_id>]         
    "type": "",                 // STATIC VALUE - (string) - use "BANK_DEFINED_PAYMENT_AGREEMENT" as value
    "status": "",               // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK OLEK table column value
    "nr": "",                   // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK TM_LEP_NR table column value      
    "startDate": ,              // DYNAMIC VALUE - (long timestamp) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK START_DATE column value, format: unix timestamp milliseconds
    "endDate": ,                // DYNAMIC VALUE - (long timestamp) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK END_DATE column value, format: unix timestamp milliseconds
    "partyRoles": [             // (list) List of all party roles related to this engagement
      {
        "roleSourceRef": "",    // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK[TM_LEP_NR], Format: <shema_name>.<table_name>[<unique record_id>].
        "partyId": "",          // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK CUSTOMER_ID 
        "role": "",             // STATIC VALUE - (string) - use "BANK_DEFINED_PAYMENT_BENEFICIARY" 
        "startDate": ,          // DYNAMIC VALUE - (long timestamp) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK START_DATE column value, format: unix timestamp milliseconds
        "endDate":              // DYNAMIC VALUE - (long timestamp) - use CREBIT.TYYP_MK END_DATE column value, format: unix timestamp milliseconds
      }
    ]
  }
}{code}
On input parameter *i_operation* value *DELETE* generate the following payload message: 
{code:java}
{
  "sourceSystemId": "",         // STATIC VALUE - (string) - use "PAYMENTS" as value 
  "correlationId": "",          // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use "YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_CREBIT.TYYP_MK[TM_LEP_NR]", Format:20240509_110414_6940174571   
  "instanceId": "",             // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string)- use  "LV" as value 
  "type": "",                   // STATIC VALUE - (string) - use "ENGAGEMENT" as value
  "lastModifiedTimestamp": ,    // DYNAMIC VALUE - (long timestamp) - use timestamp of when change happened
  "operation": "",              // STATIC VALUE - (string) possible value: "DELETE"
  "payload": {                  // (object) Details of the change
    "engagementSourceRef": ""  // DYNAMIC VALUE - (string) - use "CREBIT.TYYP_MK[TM_LEP_NR]",  Format: <shema_name>.<table_name>[<unique record_id>]         
  }
}{code}
 
----
 

*Examples* from other product areas

*UPDATE* operation (ENGAGEMENT payload example from Leasing):
{code:java}
{
   "sourceSystemId":"LEASING",
   "correlationId":"969720186_24052024112930_0XZVJ",
   "instanceId":"LV",
   "type":"ENGAGEMENT",
   "lastModifiedTimestamp":1716539370000,
   "operation":"UPDATE",
   "payload":{
      "engagementSourceRef":"HCL.OFR_OFFER_MAIN[969720186]",
      "type":"LEASING_OFFER",
      "status":"OFR_WTN",
      "nr":"PIED1665438",
      "startDate":1716498000000,
      "endDate":null,
      "partyRoles":[
         {
            "partyId":"13446236",
