column636:
05.03.2026 12:40;andmku;Issue with this query: [https://git.swedbank.net/projects/CHANNELS/repos/bank-components/browse/src/ee/hansa/bank/payments/CorporateDomesticPayment.hbm.xml#39-51]

It is always executed twice. First time with iBank channel (INP/THN), second time with open-bank channel (OBN). Issue is that the query also includes additional channels - {color:#de350b}LT{color}, {color:#de350b}HGW{color}, {color:#de350b}PKM{color}, {color:#de350b}SOP{color}. Payments for these additional channels are always selected twice.

This is a {color:#de350b}*production bug*{color} related with DPAY-3370 .;;;

