*Why:* After fraud screening is done result should be provided to Payment flow manager
*When:* 
*Where:* worker-payment-batch-handler
*What:*

Topic name: w990.batch.handler.payment.actions

CMDB ID 5919108f2bc8ee589acbfeb0de91bfc5

CMDB ID for schema: e09c4cc12bfc62100a9dff61de91bf3d (could be rechecked here [https://wiki.swedbank.net/spaces/DPAY/pages/2364835525/Kafka+topics])

Producer AD group: USG.IT.KAFKA_W990_BPAY_BATCH_HANDLING_PRIVILEGED_USER (already mapped)

Consumer AD group: SG.IT.KAFKA_W990_BPAY_BATCH_HANDLING_PAYMENT_USER (not yet mapped)

Topic should have 6 partitions.

 

Topic schema (use camelCase):

 
{code:java}
{
    "id": 1234561, #dp.id, type: number
