Debors id missing because of:
"-- In LV,EE Debtor ID and Debtor type is not filled for SEPA cross-border, in LT it is filled with value that was entered by debtor
        IF l_payment_row.out_channel_code IN (c_intragroup_out_channel_code, c_sepa_corss_b_out_channel_cd, c_eks_corss_b_out_channel_cd) THEN
          IF crebit.sysgl.get_char('OMA_MAA') = 'LT' THEN
            l_payment_row.debtor_id        := i_debtor_id;
            l_payment_row.debtor_id_type   := i_debtor_id_type;
            l_payment_row.debtor_type      := CASE WHEN i_debtor_id IS NOT NULL
            l_payment_row.debtor_id        := l_debtor_id;
            l_payment_row.debtor_id_type   := l_debtor_id_type;
            l_payment_row.debtor_type      := CASE WHEN l_debtor_id IS NOT NULL
THEN l_payment_row.debtor_type
ELSE NULL
END;
ELSE
l_payment_row.debtor_id := NULL;
l_payment_row.debtor_id_type := NULL;
l_payment_row.debtor_type := NULL;
END IF;
END IF;
END IF;
[CALLS-484] STAR SEPA cross-border have DP columns filled incorrectly - Swedbank";;;

