column47:
*Why:* TPH payments will be stored in DP tables. These payments should be not found with payment searches done in Forms/Domestic payments since that system is for SEPA payments only. TPH payments will be initially visible in TPH UI only.  

*When:* Any time

*Where:* CREBIT.PRESET_SEARCH, CREBIT.DP_IN_SEARCH_VW, SEPA_OUT_PAYMENT_LIST form (Forms)

Forms teller menus:
 * Domestic payments/Incoming search + predefined searches
 * Domestic payments/Outgoing search + predefined searches

*What:* 
 # Exclude TPH incoming payments and returns from incoming payments search result (CREBIT.DP_IN_SEARCH_VW)
 # {color:#172b4d}Exclude TPH incoming payments from predefined search 'Not processed incoming payments except investigation' (CREBIT.PRESET_SEARCH){color}
 # {color:#172b4d}Exclude TPH incoming payments from predefined search 'Incoming payments returned after crediting to account' (CREBIT.PRESET_SEARCH){color}
 # Exclude TPH and FPO outgoing payments and returns from outgoing payments search result (SEPA_OUT_PAYMENT_LIST form (block DP source)). 
 # {color:#172b4d}Exclude TPH and FPO outgoing payments from predefined search 'Incoming payments returned after crediting to account' (CREBIT.PRESET_SEARCH){color}
 # {color:#172b4d}Exclude TPH and FPO outgoing payments from predefined search '{color}Outgoing payments returned from beneficiary bank' {color:#172b4d}(CREBIT.PRESET_SEARCH){color} – {color:#de350b}is this actually impacted?{color}

 

*Info:*
 * TPH incoming payments and returns - out_channel_code's {color:#172b4d}TPHCI, TPHFI{color}
 * {color:#172b4d}TPH outgoing payments and returns - {color}out_channel_code's TPHCO, TPHFO
 * {color:#172b4d}TPH transit payments - {color}out_channel_code's {color:#172b4d}TPHCT, TPHFT{color}
 * {color:#172b4d}FPO outgoing payments (saved in DP) - out_channel_code 'FPO'{color}
 * {color:#172b4d}TPH payments will have holder_channel_code either 'TPH', 'INVS' or null{color}
 * {color:#172b4d}Following preset searches seem to be not impacted:{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Rejected outgoing SEPA payments waiting for processing{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Outgoing instant payments rejected by AML{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Outgoing instant payments waiting confirmation from benef. bank{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Outgoing payments waiting AML decision{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Risk screening solved today (in and out) {color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Incoming payments waiting AML decision{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}100K Eur limit EU sanctions for RU/BY nationals{color}

 

*Acceptance criteria/ testing notes:* 

{+}Precondition{+}: Payments with out_channel_code's {color:#172b4d}TPHCI, TPHFI, {color}TPHCO, TPHFO,{color:#172b4d} TPHCT, TPHFT, FPO exist in  CREBIT.DP or CREBIT.DP_ARH. {color}
 # Domestic payments/Incoming search does not find TPH payments and returns
 # Domestic payments/Incoming search -> predefined searches do not find TPH payments and returns
 # Domestic payments/Outgoing search does not find TPH payments and returns
 # Domestic payments/Outgoing search -> predefined searches do not find TPH payments and returns

 

(!) 'FPO' is added to scope to avoid changing same thing twice. Needed for VDE19-217 [IPR] use single data store to capture, manage and view payments through Bank Components

