column636:
06.01.2025 14:05;p998gkm;Tested in PPTE:

Testing went as follows:

First some non-existent payments were inserted into the queue:

  begin 
payments.dp_for_kafka_q_api.put_message(i_id => 12457);
commit;
end;

Select to check the status of the specific payment:

SELECT l.user_data.header.get_long_property('id'), l.*
  FROM payments.aq$q_dp_for_kafka_msg l
WHERE l.user_data.header.get_long_property('id') IN ('12457')

 

After 5 unsuccessful attempts the payment was moved out of the main queue into the dead letter queue.;;;

