20.09.2024 12:47;p998osm;3 customers were selected to check payment data: outgoing, incoming and intrabank. dispose_indicator value was temporarily changed to 'N' to be able to open these customers in STAR. For intrabank payments both sides (debtor and creditor) were checked. After obfuscation of customer data and account number, we got such results:
 * from obfuscated customer view (STAR) except account we see original data as we take it from payment. Account number was shown obfuscated, as we do not store it with payment, but we store link to valarve table. But in real life obfuscated customers will be not shown in STAR as will have dispose_indicator 'Y'.
 * from other party (intrabank payments) view (STAR and Ibank) we see all original data as we take it from payment for both incoming and outgoing.;;;

