column47:
For Round up investing solution money reserved in customer chosen account must be invested. To have those money invested, money should be taken form customer chosen account and sent to (1) securities related money account or (2) to funds purchase order. Money transfer can be initiated form investments side, but for that round up investing funds needs to be recognized.

 

{*}WHY{*}: {color:#172b4d}This will allow investments IT to process with Round up investments functionality development. This is a solution highly awaited in Baltics, as we expect to educate customers how investments can grow even starting to invest with small amounts.{color}

*WHEN:* targeted release PBREL257, 18th of July, 2024 

*WHAT:* {color:#172b4d}Create separate transaction OP IT for round-up Investments >> incoming & outgoing.{color}

*EXAMPLE:* DPAY-2896

