31.03.2023 09:36;rimmot;pacs.028 message is sent to the Beneficiary PSP in case the Originator PSP did not receive:
• an answer to a Recall;
• an answer to a Request for Recall by the Originator;
• a response to an SCT Inquiry (i.e. Claim Non-Receipt or Claim for Value Date Correction).

As an answer for recall's ST_UPDATE we expect to receive camt.029 or pacs.004 (normal flow, 15 business banking days).;;;

