column637:
20.07.2023 12:20;p997beb;Some comments after investigation and development:
The DB messages only have one local(instance) language translations in the database, one solution which would not require adding other language translations to the database is by adding them to the STAR application and selecting appropriate one based on error code returned from the database and selected locale in the application.
However, English translations are needed since it is one of the selectable languages and the fix would be a gradual progress, since we would need to add translations for every error and would also need to make changes to the error handling in application windows that are affected (which is probably most of them).;;;

