*Update:*
_If received RSF file will not have instructing/instructed agent information for pacs.002IPSv10 message and our system could not create regular canceling messages pacs.002v10, then missing information must be added accordingly:_
_Instructing agent --> RT1_BIC (IPSTFRPP);_
_instructed agent --> OMA_BIC (HABAEE2X/HABALV22/HABALT22) depending on a country._

 

New version of xsd's was provided for RSF file validation. Therefore, we need to update those XSD's in RT1 up-loader application.

XSD should be updated here: [https://git.swedbank.net/projects/DPAY/repos/payment-xml/browse/payment-xml-rt1/xsd/rt1]

XSD should be used here: [https://git.swedbank.net/projects/DPAY/repos/batch-rt1-uploader/browse]

 

Check if file data is saved in:
select * from sepa.rsf_file_rt1;
Check if incoming and outgoing pacs.008 and pacs.004 are reconciled in:
select * from sepa.reconciliation_status_rt1;
Check if all messages are being saved in: (Open question, in prod I only see pacs.008, pacs.004, camt.056 and camt.029 in this table, are other messages not needed here?)
select * from sepa.rsf_transaction_status_rt1; 
Check if we do not have final status for incoming and outgoing pacs.008 and pacs.004 if record is created in
select * from vm.sepa_paym_stat_rep order by sepa_paym_stat_rep_id desc;
and if payment status becomes final after processing (need both reject and accept)

(Testing notes: create incoming, outgoing instants with all statuses. 
For some instants make updates to have pasc.028: 
INCOMINGS: update crebit.dp set status='D', holder_channel_code = 'SPX', BENEF_TRN_VD = null, BENEF_TRN_ID = null where ID = PAYMENT_ID;
update vm.sepa_document set orig_document_id = null where direction = 'I' and document_type = 'ACCEPT' and orig_document_id = (select sepa_document_id from vm.sepa_document where local_bank_trans_id = 'PAYMENT_ID');
OUTGOINGS:
update crebit.dp set REMIT_TRN_VD = null, REMIT_TRN_ID = null, REMIT_RESERVATION_ID = null, BENEF_TRN_VD = null, BENEF_TRN_ID =null, status = 'I', holder_channel_code = 'SPX' where id = 'put_your_outgoing_instant_payment_ID_here';
update vm.sepa_document set status_code = 'S', active_flag = 'Y' where local_bank_trans_id = 'put_your_outgoing_instant_payment_ID_here';
update vm.sepa_document set ORIG_DOCUMENT_ID = null where ORIG_DOCUMENT_ID = (select sepa_document_id from vm.sepa_document where local_bank_trans_id = 'put_your_outgoing_instant_payment_ID_here');
)

