26.07.2023 13:55;p998osm;There is an income parameter p_cancel_waiting_payments in SO change agreement procedure. If value of this parameter is 'J' then procedure cancels all pending payments. 
I couldn't find any option to set value for it in test ibank LT and by default I assume comes not 'J' that is why it doesn't cancel pending payments by terminating contract.
Then there is a check in domestic and foreign payments processing procedures which terminates expired agreements. So I added there canceling of payments documents for expired or terminated contracts as well.;;;

