column636:
07.12.2023 15:55;p998fop;Proposal for adjustments to payment processing times Baltic Risk Screening. The goal is to start sending SEPA payments earlier and more frequently. Additionally, for cross border payments harmonize batch times across Baltic countries. Currently there are 2 - 2,5 hour iterations in receiving and sending SEPA domestic payments. Customers (large corporates) are complaining about stocked payments on Monday mornings. 

Configurational changes will be needed (TPS Gateway system, contact person Illimar Jaup).

 

[^Adjustments _processing_pptx (3).pptx];;;

