column47:
*Why:* E-invoice import functionality performance in iBank should be improved to ensure IBank platform stability.

Today E-invoice file of 600 lines upload takes ~60 sec.  The aim of this testing task to check & validate what E-invoice import file size could be processed during 30 sec timeout query.  

*When:* 01.10.2024-03.10.2024

*Where:* Corporate IBank LT, LV & EE

*What:* Log into Corporate IBank TEST env & try to upload and confirm E-invoice file, which would consist:
 * 200;
 * 300;
 * 400;
 * 500;

*Acceptance criteria:* please present your testing results in Comments section.

