column47:
*Why:* Migration to TPH;

*Where:* ISOX;

*When:* can be done prior to TPH start and work for pacs.004 from FP

*What:* 

Enable iso-exchange value date correction functionality for outgoing pacs.004 messages.

Settlement date in pacs.004 message is in the field: /Document/PmtRtr/TxInf/IntrBkSttlmDt

 

Reference: for outgoing pacs.008 and pacs.009 messages functionality was developed with FPAY-795 [ISO Exchange] validate and update value date of the outgoing payment message if required - Swedbank

 

*Possible impacts (changes could impact other applications/ processes etc.):*
 * if functionality is implemented prior to TPH migration, it will work for pacs.004 sent from Foreign Payments

*Acceptance criteria/ testing notes:* 
 * outgoing pacs.004 message from TPH or Foreign payments is received by iso-exchange;
 * pacs.004 message is sent to screening by iso-exchange;
 * pacs.004 message is sent to clearing system by iso-exchange with not changed settlement date if screening response is received prior the cut-off time;
 * pacs.004 message is sent to clearing system by iso-exchange with corrected settlement date if screening response is received after the cut-off time;
 * both original and corrected versions of pacs.004 message XML are stored in ISOX database;
 * Foreign Payments application can show both versions of XML in message search functionality

