column638:
06.01.2026 11:36;p998osm;For QA:
1. order account alias (new record in account_alias.alias, id is not null)
2. revoke account alias (record disappeared from account_alias.alias, appeared in account_alias.alias_log (for new record id has to be not null, for historical records it can be null) and account_alias.alias_arch (id is not null))
3. make payment by phone number (payment is successful)
4. all records in account_alias.alias have prefilled id:
  SELECT COUNT(*) FROM account_alias.alias WHERE id IS NULL;
5. all records from alias_log where LOG_ACTION='D' exist in alias_arch:
   SELECT COUNT(*) FROM account_alias.alias_log WHERE log_action = 'D';
   SELECT COUNT(*) FROM account_alias.alias_arch WHERE status = 'REMOVED'
   AND valid_until IS NOT NULL;;;;

