column47:
Issue: Can submit a payment, with an empty "Amount" field

Steps to reproduce:
 * Select a defined payment, clear "Amount" field;
 *  Clear the beneficiary field ("X" button);
 * Add another payment, clear the "Amount" field;
 * Click "Sign with PIN2"/"Confirm" button;

Expected: User can't submit a payment

Actual: User can submit the payment, but gets a technical error (Signing with Smart-ID failed)

 

