column47:
When consuming GRPC payment service CurrencyConversionEcb API the small amounts of foreign currency are converted to amount of 0 ir EUR currency.

*Expectation:*
small amounts to be converted to 0.01 EUR

*Sample Request:*
{
    "amount": {
        "decimal_representation": "0.04"
    },
    "currency": {
        "value": "SEK"
    }
}

*Response:*
{
    "amountInEur": {
        "decimal_representation": "0"
    }
}

