column636:
01.04.2026 10:21;p998kkt;As it comes to RT1 then EBA Clearing has confirmed that the camt.054 XSD will change in Q2 2026 indeed and it will be aligned to the one of TIPS, but the camt.052 will remain the same (no XSD change).

As of now RT1 will continue to use the same XSD as TIPS for RT1.

So "TIPS_camt_054.001.12.xsd" in the folder "RT1 20260130 SCT Inst Schema RT Message V20260613" would be the XSD to be referred concerning the camt.054.;;;

