column636:
21.01.2025 09:23;andmku;Value date is in UTC timezone ("2025-01-{*}16Z{*}") in the message. Since we're in UTC+2/3 zone, we need to adjust the date. We don't know the exact time, so current time is used.

[~annyk] -, what do you recommend to do in this case? Could we use some other timestamp from the message as a time reference for value date, or just ignore timezone?-

00:00 should be used as a time reference for value date. That would result in following conversion: 2025-01-16Z -> 2025-01-16T00:00Z -> 2025-01-16T02:00+02:00 -> 2025-01-16 .;;;

