column47:
*Why:* SWIFT MT940/942 statements shall have also information on payments processed by TPH

*When:* Latest by TPH incoming payments go live

*Where:* Swift services (Homebank) -> Send MT940/942 (package: VV_SWIFT)

*What:* Change MT940/942 statement details as follows:

1. *"Customer reference" field* (Reference for the Account Owner (Field 61, subfield 7)) should be filled as follows:
 * Incoming payment: Align International payment -and SEPA cross-border payment- with domestic payment:
 ** POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.CUSTOMER_REFERENCE in case length is up to 16x;
 ** when CUSTOMER_REFERENCE length is >16x or missing then "NONREF".

 * Outgoing payment: 
 ** {color:#172b4d}If initiated via MT101: VM.SW_PAYMENT_ORDER.REMIT_REF; {color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}otherwise: POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION. DOCUMENT_NUMBER; {color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}when missing then "NONREF"{color}

2. *"Bank reference" field* (Reference of the Account Servicing Institution (Field 61, subfield 8)) should be filled as follows:
 * Incoming/outgoing international payment (before TPH): no changes
 ** {color:#172b4d}POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.SYSTEM_REFERENCE {color}
 * Incoming/outgoing international payment (TPH{-}, SEPA cross-border){-}:
 ** Transaction archival code (same as for SEPA domestic)

3. *"Information to account owner" field* (Field 86):
 * Incoming payment: Lines 3-6: For TPH International payment -and SEPA cross-border payment- {-}remittance info with domestic payment{-}:
 ** {color:#172b4d}Line 1: POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.COUNTERPARTY_NAME{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Line 2: POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.COUNTERPARTY_ACCOUNT{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Line 3-6: {color}
 *** {color:#172b4d}If POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.CUSTOMER_REFERENCE is longer than 16x (was not added to field 61) then '/RFB/' || CUSTOMER_REFERENCE on line 3, followed by
POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.TRANSACTION_DETAILS (CREBIT.DP.UNSTRUCTURED_REMITTANCE_INFO) on lines 4-6{color}
 *** {color:#172b4d}Otherwise POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.TRANSACTION_DETAILS {color}
 * Outgoing payment:
 ** {color:#172b4d}Line 1: POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.COUNTERPARTY_NAME{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Line 2: POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.COUNTERPARTY_ACCOUNT{color}
 ** {color:#172b4d}Line 3-6: POSITION_KEEPING.TRANSACTION.TRANSACTION_DETAILS {color}

*Testing notes:*

Minimum to test:
 # Incoming TPH payment (out_channel_code='TPHCI')
 # -Incoming SEPA cross-border payment (out_channel_code='SEPCI')-
 # Outgoing TPH payment (out_channel_code='TPHCO')
 # -Outgoing SEPA cross-border payment (out_channel_code='SEPCO')-

More info: [TPH payments on Customer Statement|https://wiki.swedbank.net/display/DPAY/TPH+payments+on+Customer+Statement#TPHpaymentsonCustomerStatement-ProvideTPHpaymentdatainMT940,MT942statement]

