20.03.2025 09:08;p998osm;For testing purpose before fix and after fix we started 8 processes to simulate payment load for SEPA outgoing:
BEGIN
  crebit.sysgl.set_global('SIMULATE_PMT_LOAD_ENABLED', 'N'); -- stop running simulation
  COMMIT;
  crebit.sysgl.set_global('SIMULATE_PMT_LOAD_ENABLED', 'Y'); -- enable simulation
  crebit.sysgl.set_global('SIMULATE_PMT_OIP_PROC_NUMBER', '0'); -- set processes number for Outging Instant
  crebit.sysgl.set_global('SIMULATE_PMT_ITR_PROC_NUMBER', '0'); -- set processes number for Intrabank
  crebit.sysgl.set_global('SIMULATE_PMT_SEPO_PROC_NUMBER', '8'); -- set processes number for SEPA
  payments.payment_load_simulation_pkg.start_pmt_load;
END;
It generated ~ 47000 payments.
After fix number of executions for 6 queries was decreased from 13353 to 387
Testing results: EASYPAY-886 SQL_statistics.xlsx;;;

