column637:
04.06.2025 10:01;p998gkm;Tested in PPTE LT/LV/EE:

Made a payment in ibank and saved it to list of payments. Edited such payment data in DB to change its currency to USD, removed holder channel, out channel code set to FPO. If in_channel_code is left to any value but not HGW then it's needed to change channel status to M in CREBIT.DP_OUT_THN.

After that the procedure was executed:

DECLARE

  l_result VARCHAR2(1000);

BEGIN

payments.fpo_payment.ps_process(2801452593, l_result);

  dbms_output.put_line('l_result: ' || l_result);

END;

After running and commiting - payment's status was changed to C and procedure executed successfully. (Also important to commit changes after running the procedure)

 ;;;

