column47:
*Steps to reproduce:*

 
 # Payment file status ->  *PF_Validated* (single payment file which is not signed);
 # Payment files should be split to batches. Batch status should be *B_Registered*
 # Batch +*should*+ *+not be split to payments+*
 # Initiate recovery process

[EASYPAY-1403] Implement payment file recovery process - validating batches - Swedbank

*Expected result:* Batch should be split to paraments and accordingly the status of payment file and batch should be changed;

 

*Actual results:*  Batch was not split to payments;

*Steps to reproduce:*

 
 # Payment file status -> validated (payment file contains mass payments);
 # No batch or payments are created for this payment file;
 # Recovery process is initiated

 

*Actual results:* batch and payments are created. to Kafka topic payment orders information about payments is sent but mass payment header is not sent;

 

*Expected:* mass payment header is sent to Kafka topic payment orders

