column47:
*Issue:* 
If you select another user's account from the list of accounts in Smart Form, you'll get a technical error when calling the service.

Limit service response:
{code:java}
{
  "title":"Bad request.",
  "timestamp":"2025-09-19T06:56:26+0000",
  "path":"POST:/api/v1/limits/payment/LV/usages/internetBank/validate",
  "status":400,
  "errorMessages":{
    "general":[
	  {"code":"NOT_FOUND","message":"Unable to find limit info for customer : user : account (13151088 : 3449417 : 551046319369)!"}
	],
  "fields":[]}
}
{code}

Need to replace parameter currentCustomerId in the request with selectedAccountCustomerId:
{code:java}
from actionContext.getCurrentCustomerId()

to actionContext.getProfile().getCurrentAccount().getOwnerId()
{code}

