column636:
10.10.2025 08:04;p998gzv;During the analysis, it was identified that the field position_keeping.transaction.COUNTERPARTY_TAXPAYER_CODE is limited to 20 characters. For incoming payments, if the payer's ID type is TXID, we pass the payer's ID value to the crediting procedure and populate the COUNTERPARTY_TAXPAYER_CODE field accordingly.

The payer's ID can be up to 35 characters long. Therefore a short-term solution is proposed to implement a quick fix where the payer's ID is truncated to 20 characters within the application and stored in to the field COUNTERPARTY_TAXPAYER_CODE.

A long-term solution will involve extending the mentioned field to 35 characters. A separate task will be created for this purpose.;;;

