column47:
*Issue:* 

GRPC service API PaymentPriorityOutChannelCode (EASYPAY-912) is used in Flow Manager and returns out channel code RTGS where FPO is expected. 

*Steps to reproduce:*

Request data:
{code:json}
{
    "id": 2536185297,
    "bkIntPrtryInf": {
        "procgInf": {
            "docDt": "2026-01-13",
            "valDt": "2026-01-13"
        },
        "orgtrInf": {
            "inChnlCd": "HGW"
        },
        "rltdSys": [
            {
                "cd": "PBH_ID",
                "ref": "1"
            },
            {
                "cd": "PMNT_LIMIT",
                "ref": "2"
            },
            {
                "cd": "PBH_HID",
                "ref": "3"
            }
        ],
        "pties": {
            "dbtr": {
                "cstmrId": "B0000051"
            }
        }
    },
    "pmtInf": {
        "cdtTrfTxInf": {
            "pmtTpInf": {
                "lclInstrm": {
                    "prtry": "HIGH"
                },
                "svcLvl": {
                    "cd": "NURG"
                }
            },
            "pmtId": {
                "endToEndId": "EndToEndId999113"
            },
            "instdAmt": 8.57,
            "instdAmtCcy": "EUR",
            "rmtInf": {
                "ustrd": "New 2"
            }
        },
        "agts": {
            "dbtrAgt": {
                "finInstnId": {
                    "bicfi": "HABALV22"
                }
            },
            "cdtrAgt": {
                "finInstnId": {
                    "bicfi": "EPBEEE2XXXX"
                }
            }
        },
        "pties": {
            "dbtr": {
                "nm": "VIESTURS TEST",
                "acct": {
                    "id": {
                        "iban": "LV70HABA0551053149810"
                    }
                }
            },
            "cdtr": {
                "nm": "Test SEPA International",
                "acct": {
                    "id": {
                        "iban": "EE031600000162175048"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
} {code}
Response, full response not logged, only the needed attributes:
{noformat}
o.c.j.d.PaymentPriorityAndOutChannelCode: Service response for paymentPriority: U, outChannelCode: RTGS and errorCode: null
{noformat}
 

*Expected results:*

According to a table Annika Vaher created recently it should return FPO as out channel code. Table confirmed with other analysts to be true to current understanding.

!image-2026-01-16-10-18-52-692.png|width=930,height=526!

*Actual results:* 
Returns RTGS

